direction: right
call: claude -p call
retry: Retry transient error
repair: Repair malformed JSON
output: Agent output
publish: Publish
qa: QA evaluator
p0: P0 flag
call -> retry: transient failure
retry -> call
call -> repair: broken JSON
repair -> output
call -> output: valid JSON
output -> publish
publish -> qa: after publish
qa -> p0: silent failure found
